Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.87,0:00:11.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:12.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:33.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（海松海事博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望我们继续他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真名叫贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot's her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说就很不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means seriously bad luck for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty frigging far from a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为特定客户获取一些独特的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I procure unique items for a select clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会发现那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我一直在努力保住你的命 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm busting my ass trying to keep you alive, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却一副毫不在乎的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you act like you couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我累了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I'm tired, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 感觉就像隧道尽头有了光亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It's like there's a light at the end of the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是地狱烈火 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hellfire, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.81,0:00:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I wouldn't do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我需要做什么 我一定要帮你脱困\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't care what it takes. I'm gonna get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能为你做什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. What can I do for you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上解除迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can let Dean out of his deal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是推销的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a saleswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也像其他人一样有老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a boss like everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,合同在他手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He holds the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的老板是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.21,0:00:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事没有出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's no way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开枫泉镇我就一直在等\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've been waiting since Maple Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有话要跟我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没到你生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷发快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy perm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯尔特枪少了颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bullet missing from the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,想告诉我是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna tell me how that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it wasn't me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以除非你去射击非常邪恶的罐子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so unless you were shooting at some incredibly evil cans…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 你去找她了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - You went after her, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,十字路口恶魔 尽管我叫你别去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Crossroads Demon, after I told you not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会害死自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have gotten yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打死了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you shot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是自作聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我摆脱交易了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, does that mean I'm out of my deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是 你不觉得我肯定早说了吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think I might have mentioned that little fact, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,合同在其他人手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else holds the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好查明是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我们的最佳线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, of course, our best lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be the Crossroads Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个愚蠢的风险 你不该那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a stupid frigging risk and you shouldn't have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have done it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我哥哥 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做什么 我都会努力救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you do, I'm gonna try and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我绝不会为此道歉 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure as hell not gonna apologize for it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经跟其他警探说过这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already went over all this with the other detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们是郡警局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but see, we're with the Sheriff's Department…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是警察局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not the Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,部门不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different departments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mrs. Case…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊我凯斯女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Case…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你发现了你侄女 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were the one who found your niece, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came home,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在淋浴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drowned?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死因裁判官是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the coroner says.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人怎么可能在淋浴里淹死\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can someone drown in a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.11,0:05:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得茜拉死前几天里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you describe Sheila's behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,行为如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the days before her death?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是否看上去害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, did she seem frightened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是提过什么不寻常的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she said something out of the ordinary, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是跟艾莉克丝合作的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working with Alex, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Absolutely. That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克丝和我们 关系可铁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex and us, we're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克丝给了我好大安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex has been such a comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但抱歉 我以为案子都结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sorry, I thought the case was solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:05:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no. No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样啊 - 总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see. - So, anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚在说你侄女\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were talking about your niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,茜拉死前是提到过一件怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila mentioned something quite strange before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她看见了一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she saw a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 前一刻还在 转眼就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, one minute it was there, then it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她眼前凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just disappeared right before her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it could be a.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克丝觉得可能是鬼船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex thinks it could be a ghost ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我还能帮到你 你尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}you let me know if there's anything else I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个老疯婆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a crazy old broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 因为她相信鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, because she believes in ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你啊 维护你女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you sticking up for your girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个熟女控\N{\fnArial\fs30}you cougar hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她先动口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if she bites you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个艾莉克丝是谁 城里还有别的猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's this Alex? We got another player in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的工作还是不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't change our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的推论是鬼船 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're thinking ghost ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 而且这一带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's not the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是第一次有人看到鬼船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's been sighted around here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔37年都会出现 准时准点 一艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}every 37 years, like clockwork, reports of a vanishing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,三桅高速帆船在海湾里忽隐忽现\N{\fnArial\fs30}three-mast clipper ship out in the bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔37年 便会出现一系列怪异的陆上溺亡事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every 37 years, a rash of weirdo dry-land drownings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不管怎么回事 这才是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever's happening is just getting started?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the lore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都有看到老旧幽灵沉船的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are apparitions of old wrecks sighted all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫罗兰号 格里芬号 飞翔的荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The S.S. Violet, the Griffon, the Flying Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎都是死亡预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost all of them are death omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么个情况 你看到船\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens? You see the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then a few hours later…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you pucker up and kiss your ass goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the next step?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得确认是哪艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta ID the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海岸沉没的三桅高速帆船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many three-mast clipper ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有几艘啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}are wrecked off the coast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我也查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked that too, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,150多艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 150.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是把车停这里了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we parked the car, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给停车表投币了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you feed the meter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I fed the meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我的车呢 有人偷我车了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, where's my car? Somebody stole my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冷静 有人偷了我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am calmed down. Someone stole my…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,67年的英帕拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The '67 Impala?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我让人把车拖走了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had that car towed. - You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,车停在拖走区里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was in a tow-away zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鼓捣完后就在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was when I finished with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.05,0:08:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就玩玩游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little yachting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是艾莉克丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟那位老太太合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working with that old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,格特是位老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gert's a dear old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 你有什么目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. What's your angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,东海岸有好多格特这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of lovely old women like Gert…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的老妇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}up and down the eastern seaboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖她们魔咒 进行招魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sell them charms, perform seances…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她们跟自己死去的猫交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can commune with their dead cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 都是骗人的 都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess. It's all a con, none of it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供的安慰可非常真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The comfort I provide them is very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上怎么睡得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you sleep at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡在丝绸床单上 裸着身在钱里打滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}On silk sheets, rolling naked in money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我这么冲我不意外 但你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd expect the attitude from him. But you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿枪打了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也就擦伤了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely grazed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有点夸张 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a bit of a drama queen, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚现在的情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know what's going on around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘鬼船是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ghost ship thing, it is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 谢谢你们告诉格特案子没结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for telling Gert the case wasn't solved, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是没结 - 她原本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It isn't. - She didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下那老婆子停止了付款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the old bag's stopped payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要求知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's demanding some real answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别碍我事 别给我惹更多麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just stay out of my way before you cause any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是赶紧去把车取回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd get to that car if I were you…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得他们发现后备箱里的军火库\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they find the arsenal in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以开枪打她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I shoot her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别当众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 警方说他淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the police said that he drowned, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不懂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand how…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很为您的丧亲遗憾 沃伦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry for your loss, Mr. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以再跟我说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you could just tell me one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥看到的船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the ship your brother saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 我觉得他已经很痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, I think this man's been through quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还有几个问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just have a few more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你抽时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉你还得应付她 他们简直像蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry you had to deal with that. They're like roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到你说你哥哥看到过艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, we heard you say your brother saw a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说过那船什么样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you what it looked like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像老洋基快船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, uh, like the old Yankee Clippers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走私船\N{\fnArial\fs30}a smuggling vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,气派的上桅帆 三桅船索具\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rakish topsail, a barkentine rigging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,船首上有天使艏饰像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel figurehead on the bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥看到的船你能说得这么详细\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of detail for a ship your brother saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥和我当时在夜间潜水\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and I were night diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看到那船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the ship too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 警官 我觉得那俩人不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, officers. I'm not sure those men…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们再联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, we'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们取回了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you got your car back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手里有上膛的枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really wanna come near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想靠近我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I got a loaded gun in my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小心血压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, mind your blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you even still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有足够信息查到船名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have enough to ID the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚那人看到船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy back there saw the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是炮灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们赶不及救他的 你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't be saved in time and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可我们有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, see, we have souls. So.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能找到那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, I'm actually gonna find the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好好玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你怎么会变成这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela, how'd you get like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.31,0:13:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 爸爸抱你不够多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did Daddy not give you enough hugs or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸抱你够多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daddy give you enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你少看不起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare look down your nose at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.11,0:13:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没比我强到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no better than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这么做是出于复仇和执迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do this out of vengeance and obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们离连环杀手也就一步之遥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a stone's throw from being a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereas I, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收钱做事 我会把事办妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get paid to do a job, and I do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是说 谁更健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you tell me, which is healthier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela, why don't you just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有工作要做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你们现在0：2呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're 0 for 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bang-up job so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:13:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.33,0:14:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名兄弟都是杜克大学的毕业生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, both brothers are Duke University grads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有犯罪记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}No criminal record.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些超速罚单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a few speeding tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前他们继承了父亲的地产遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}They inherited their father's real-estate fortune six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,1.12亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundred twelve million.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 命真好 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice life. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,干净体面 正正当当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, nice, clean, aboveboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么会看到船\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why'd they see the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有茜拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Sheila too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有什么共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they all have in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有点什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's always something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we've been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么 在监视我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing? You watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, calm down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys aren't cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察不会穿成那样 开那样的破车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not dressed like that. Not in that crappy car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没必要这么嘴贱啊 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No need to get nasty. - Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是警察 我们在卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are cops, okay? We're undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来是因为我们觉得你可能有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here, because we think you're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你冷静下来 我们谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just settle down, we'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you guys, just stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个白痴 我们是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You moron, we're trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那绝不是好事 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That can't be good. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿岩盐枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the salt gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚起初原本只是可能略有微风\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what started out as a mild chance of breezy night,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但严酷的锋面从西北而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is changing rapidly as a severe weather front,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让情况急转直下\N{\fnArial\fs30}is heading in from the northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.59,0:16:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷电交加和突然降雨可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expect heavy lightning and thunder with sudden rainfall…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说 还是我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna say it or should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能救下每个人 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save everybody, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 对 怎么 这样你就好受些了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. So what, you feel better now or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我近来觉得我谁都救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lately I feel like I can't save anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是真在占房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you actually squatting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚跟彼得进展如何啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd things go last night with Peter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说「我早说了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say "I told you so, "
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我会开始挥拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, I'll start swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们三个该交交心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the three of us should have a heart-to-heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得有心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's assuming you have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为之前的话道歉 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about what I said before, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带礼物来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已查到船名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ID'd the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣灵号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Espirito Santo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,商用帆船 历史很丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}A merchant sailing vessel. Quite a colorful history.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,1859年 一名水手被控叛国\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1859, a sailor was accused of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在船上的私设法庭受审 然后被绞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was tried aboard ship in a kangaroo court and hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时才37\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 37.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才37年一循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which would explain the 37-year cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真机灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a sharp tack?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有他的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photo of him somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们昨晚见到的那人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the customer we saw last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是他 但他缺了只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's him, except he was missing a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}His right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,水手的尸体被火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sailor's body was cremated,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们先切下了他的手 制作光荣之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not before they cut off his hand to make a Hand of Glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,光荣之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hand of Glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上周做完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰式按摩后 好像享受过那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the end of my Thai massage last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:18:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 绞死的人的右手是厉害的魔物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the right hand of a hanged man is a serious occult object.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,法力强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且也能算是遗骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And officially counts as remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这还是不能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still, none of this explains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼为何选择这些受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}why the ghost is choosing these victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.43,0:19:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧了他 阻止那鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}burn it and stop the bloody thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂 你为什么告诉我们这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. Why you telling us all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我清楚手在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know exactly where the hand is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海松博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the Sea Pines Museum…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为海事历史的恐怖展品\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a macabre bit of maritime history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么那么慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆都快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's already halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他的女伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his date.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太让人不爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not okay with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come down already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 说吧 我样子很滑稽\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Get it out. I look ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly the word I'd use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when this is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该来次愤怒性爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should really have angry sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别物化我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't objectify me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在嚼口香糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you chewing gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:21:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量表现得像你来过这样的场合 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to behave as if you've lived this life before, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.69,0:21:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让大家嚼舌头根的 是吧 我的美男\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will get their tongues wagging, eh, my Adonis?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 我们是为正事而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember, we're on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时 正事也能有乐趣吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes business can be pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我可以失陪一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, could you excuse me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我究竟需要陪我的女伴多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly how long do you expect me to entertain my date?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.84,0:21:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多久是多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:22:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处是保安 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}security all over this place. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有格特的邀请函 我们别想闯进这派对来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an uncrashable party without Gert's invitation, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都能闯 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can crash anything, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更轻松 也更好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is easier and it's a lot more entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我肯做的事是有限度的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there are limits to what I'll do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在欲擒故纵呢 真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's playing hard to get. That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上要把一切都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want all the details in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:22:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,私人安保吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private security?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.49,0:23:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们的站姿 他们是专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the way they're standing. They're pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是来兼职的州警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably state troopers moonlighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个门口都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posted at every door too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.92,0:23:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们别想大摇大摆地上楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't think we're gonna be able to just waltz upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.42,0:23:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.63,0:23:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.67,0:23:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别累着自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't strain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思 某些人名不副实呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting how the legend is so much more than the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.18,0:23:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有好点子 我洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any bright ideas, I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey? Honey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.07,0:23:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,侍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.57,0:23:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子对贝类严重过敏 那里面没螃蟹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife has a severe shellfish allergy. There's no crab in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 先生 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, sir. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.37,0:23:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're excellent, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.87,0:23:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What seems to be the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.16,0:23:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.75,0:23:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子 她酒量特别差\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife, she's a lightweight when it comes to the sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.71,0:23:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让她在哪躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there somewhere I can lay her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓缓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}till she gets her sea legs back?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow me. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.51,0:24:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.18,0:24:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你个酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you lush.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为她现在就是个麻烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's a pain in the ass now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.69,0:24:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她一起生活更烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try living with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.23,0:24:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许下次 实施计划前先跟我说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe next time, give me a little heads up with your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.62,0:24:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.24,0:24:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不太擅长那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not very good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.67,0:24:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力想说出一句俏皮话怼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching for a witty rejoinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.58,0:24:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真像大文豪奥斯卡·王尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very Oscar Wilde.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.72,0:24:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,235室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 235.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.01,0:24:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上锁玻璃箱里 有报警器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in a locked glass case wired for alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.80,0:24:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不成问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that won't be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.49,0:25:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克丝和你的朋友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Alex and your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.57,0:25:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们错过好派对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're missing a great party.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定也自己找乐子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, ahh… I'm sure they're entertaining themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.20,0:25:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.21,0:25:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们也要自己找乐子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess we'll just have to entertain ourselves as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.71,0:25:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 凯斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, um, Mrs. Case…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.09,0:25:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.47,0:25:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凯斯女士 我不希望你误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Case, I don't wanna give you the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.51,0:25:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊我格特吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me Gert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起我去世的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of my late husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.85,0:25:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也很害羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was shy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了下面才放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till we got below deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.99,0:25:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是浑身结实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just firm all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.54,0:26:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来您好些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling better, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.09,0:26:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好多了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, much, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.38,0:26:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不需要这房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're done with the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.43,0:26:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.81,0:26:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以再给我们点时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we have a few more minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.89,0:26:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 好痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. That tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.74,0:27:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,内急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature called.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.62,0:27:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢照顾我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for looking after my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.70,0:27:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人照顾她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's being looked after all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.55,0:27:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么我不能应付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I couldn't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.43,0:27:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.44,0:27:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.27,0:27:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许放我手包里更隐蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be more inconspicuous in my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.65,0:27:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.11,0:27:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your kind of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这首歌好长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is one long song.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.46,0:28:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它永不结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.96,0:28:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the investigation going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.59,0:28:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things take time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都在谈论沃伦兄弟的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, people are talking about the Warren brothers' deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.14,0:28:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那跟茜拉的死有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it's connected to Sheila's?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.35,0:28:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, we think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.14,0:28:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们是活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they had it coming, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.35,0:28:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因果报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a Biblical sort of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.65,0:28:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们父亲的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about their father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.28,0:28:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.99,0:28:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我悄悄告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. I'll whisper it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.79,0:28:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the old man…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是自然死亡 - 那是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- didn't die of natural causes. - Then how?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,据传 是兄弟俩干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor is the boys did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.38,0:28:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然没法证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing was ever proved but…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.34,0:28:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但人们还是会传话 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- people still whisper. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.30,0:28:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那茜拉跟他们有关联吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did Sheila have any connection to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, none that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.43,0:29:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,茜拉人生里发生过什么惨剧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Sheila have any kind of tragedy in her life?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.73,0:29:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还真发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, as a matter of fact…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.06,0:29:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她十几岁时出过车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a car accident when she was a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.98,0:29:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的车翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her car flipped over and.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事 但她表哥布莱恩死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, she was okay, but, uh, her cousin Brian was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.03,0:29:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 这要紧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Is that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.95,0:29:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}having a nice time?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.09,0:29:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带格特去冲个冷水澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get Gert into a cold shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.22,0:29:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.47,0:29:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,公墓见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you at the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.51,0:29:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一身骚气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stink like sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.20,0:29:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.12,0:30:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我 我不是白白被\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me I didn't get groped all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.83,0:30:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,郝薇香太太摸了一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Mrs. Haversham for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.58,0:30:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.71,0:30:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. Just let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.62,0:30:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.19,0:31:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.60,0:31:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓慢折磨才是好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think slow torture's the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.44,0:31:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着 你得放松下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look. You gotta relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.36,0:31:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.19,0:31:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'll relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.32,0:31:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信她又胜了我们一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe she got another one over on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.11,0:31:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.24,0:31:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.29,0:31:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她胜了你 不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she got one over on you, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.21,0:31:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆 非常有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sam. Very helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.72,0:31:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗 可以开门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Could you open up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.94,0:31:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.60,0:31:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.61,0:31:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说它后就找好了买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a buyer lined up as soon as I knew it existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以骗我们去慈善舞会是为了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the whole reason for us going to the charity ball was…?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要个掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed a cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正方便了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.25,0:32:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卖给了买家 那去买回来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you sold it to a buyer, just go buy it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.62,0:32:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在漂洋过海了 来不及要回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's halfway across the ocean. I can't get it back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.08,0:32:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.13,0:32:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you, Bela?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像是见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you've seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.55,0:32:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.39,0:32:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.56,0:32:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.02,0:32:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是个不道德的骗子小贼贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were an immoral, thieving, con-artist bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.31,0:32:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就当我以为我对你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just when I thought my opinion of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.81,0:32:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会更差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't get any lower…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.82,0:32:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.23,0:32:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查明鬼魂的动机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured out the spirit's motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.32,0:32:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是鬼船的船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the captain of our ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.87,0:32:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,绞死了那个鬼魂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one who hung our ghost boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.33,0:32:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.71,0:32:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they were brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.25,0:32:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真像该隐和亚伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very Cain and Abel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now our spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.75,0:33:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他针对的是一种特定的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's going after a very specific kind of target.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.30,0:33:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死了自己亲人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who've spilled their own family's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.80,0:33:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是茜拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, first there was Sheila,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.85,0:33:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在车祸中害死了表哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}who killed her cousin in a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.93,0:33:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是沃伦兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the Warren brothers…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.39,0:33:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为谋遗产杀害了父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}who murdered their father for the inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.77,0:33:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.91,0:33:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.94,0:33:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是谁 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who was it, Bela?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.73,0:33:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.24,0:33:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little sis, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.99,0:33:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.12,0:33:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.58,0:33:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那祝你人生愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have a nice life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仅剩的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, whatever's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.54,0:33:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.55,0:33:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能丢下我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.76,0:33:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.55,0:33:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.06,0:33:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our help?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.56,0:33:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个连环杀手怎么能帮你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how could a couple of serial killers possibly help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.31,0:33:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那话有些过分了 我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that was a bit harsh. I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.69,0:34:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也不该为此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't warrant a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.57,0:34:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你要死的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not why you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.15,0:34:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么 贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do, Bela?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.74,0:34:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.82,0:34:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.95,0:34:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.83,0:34:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是像以往一样 自己解决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just do what I've always done and I'll deal with it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.09,0:34:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你刚卖掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize you just sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.09,0:34:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能救你命的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing that could save your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.59,0:34:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.85,0:34:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许不是唯一的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not the only thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.58,0:35:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得这能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.17,0:35:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.48,0:35:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.94,0:35:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点读吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better start reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.05,0:35:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.11,0:35:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.46,0:36:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 快读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, read faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.90,0:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绞死了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hanged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.95,0:36:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.50,0:37:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的亲弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.37,0:37:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.79,0:37:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该知道锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys should learn to lock your doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.84,0:37:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都可能冲进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could just barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.96,0:37:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是有人进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.76,0:37:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来道别的 还是说谢谢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come to say goodbye or thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.17,0:37:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来做个了断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to settle affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.30,0:38:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足那鬼魂的心愿 把他哥哥给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving the spirit what he really wanted, his own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.14,0:38:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very clever, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.76,0:38:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.27,0:38:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 10, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.89,0:38:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢欠人什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like being in anyone's debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.48,0:38:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以掏一万\N{\fnArial\fs30}So ponying up 10 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.61,0:38:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你比说声「谢谢」要简单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is easier for you than a simple "thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.03,0:38:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.29,0:38:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.80,0:38:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真有风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got style.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.17,0:38:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta give her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.46,0:38:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.55,0:38:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们都不知道这钱怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dean, we don't know where this money's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.39,0:38:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.18,0:38:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道这钱要怎么花\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know where it's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.60,0:38:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.77,0:38:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大西洋城吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlantic City?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.48,0:38:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.86,0:38:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩玩轮盘赌 永远压黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play some roulette, always bet on black.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.24,0:39:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我想了想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've been doing some thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.12,0:39:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你 我理解你为什么那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know I understand why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.04,0:39:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你为什么去找十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand why you went after the Crossroads Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果情况调过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the situation was reversed,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.29,0:39:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概也会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'd have done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.46,0:39:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不瞎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.01,0:39:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得到这整件事对你的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see what you're going through with this whole deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me going away and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.23,0:39:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.35,0:39:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你会继续猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'll keep hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.61,0:39:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,过你的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you'll live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.61,0:39:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我坚强 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than me. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.65,0:39:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are. You'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.03,0:39:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要说 对不起 抱歉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you to know I'm sorry. I'm sorry for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.20,0:39:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你经受这一切 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting you through all this, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.66,0:39:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 迪恩 去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean? Go screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.70,0:39:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我不想听你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I don't want an apology from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.54,0:39:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我是个大人了 我能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way, I'm a big boy now. I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.93,0:39:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.83,0:39:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你能不能别再担心我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So would you quit worrying about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.17,0:39:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's the whole problem in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.59,0:39:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你担心我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to worry about me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.84,0:40:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你担心你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.09,0:40:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你在乎你要死了这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to give a crap that you're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.35,0:40:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想再说点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else to say from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.07,0:40:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我要玩双骰子赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe I'll play craps.
